  "change_summary": "Clinician review draft: preserve the legacy minimum-priority calculation, age conversion, vital thresholds, and pain escalation while requiring age and representing named signs as explicit priority groups. Named HTML controls and scored choices are preserved; aggregate counts/sign groups are derived from typed responses. Assign every field to its declared form section. Supersedes engineering review.1; remains unapproved. Complete HTML field and option coverage; preserve radio and multiline controls. Supersedes engineering review.2.",
